OL,4,BShevchenko accuses Mudryk camp of      
OL,5,B'baseless slander'                     
OL,6,GUkraine great Andriy Shevchenko has    
OL,7,Gaccused Mykhailo Mudryk's              
OL,8,Grepresentatives of repeatedly asking   
OL,9,Gfor an employee of the country's       
OL,10,Gfootball federation to "falsely" take  
OL,11,Gthe blame for the winger's positive    
OL,12,Gdrugs test.                            
OL,14,FTottenham winger Mudryk, who is on a   
OL,15,Fseason-long loan from Chelsea, was     
OL,16,Fsuspended from November 2024 until     
OL,17,FJuly 2026 after testing positive for   
OL,18,Fthe banned substance meldonium.        
